  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0efce07e219505f4a9159aec8c391bb5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SecretaryFarewellLetterUI
  fpsController: {fileID: 1485733404}
  lookInteractor: {fileID: 1485733406}
  letterPanel: {fileID: 367554361}
  letterText: {fileID: 1528023930}
  closeButton: {fileID: 1563936766}
  letterBody: 'Doctor,


    I cannot stay here any longer. Too many people have
    died in too few days, and the fear in this village has become unbearable. I joined
    this clinic to help, but what I see now is beyond anything I can endure.


    I
    hope you find peace, whatever path leads you there.


    Goodbye.'
